===Etymology 2===
{{clipping|vi|hành hạ}}.

The noun sense is most likely coined from the homophony of the unrelated noun above, leading to further coinage of phrases like {{m|vi|bán hành||to be bashed|lit=to sell scallion}}, {{m|vi|bón hành||to be bashed|lit=to spoon-feed scallion}}, {{m|vi|ăn hành||to be bashed|lit=to eat scallion}}.

====Verb====
{{vi-verb}}

# {{diminutive of|vi|hành hạ}}
#: {{ux|vi|Bị cơn sốt '''hành''' suốt đêm.|'''Suffered''' from fever the whole night.}}

====Noun====
{{vi-noun}}

# {{lb|vi|slang}} to be [[bash]]ed
#: {{ux|vi|Nhân vật chính đang bị phản diện bán '''hành'''.|The protagonist is '''getting the shit beaten out of him''' by the villain.}}

